WEBVTT - The Morning Ferry
Kind: captions
Language: en

STYLE
::cue(.loud) { color: orange; }

NOTE
Written for Greece's test fixtures.

intro
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.800 align:center
The morning ferry leaves Piraeus at seven.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.900
<v Eleni><i>Kalimera.</i> Two tickets to Naxos, please.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.500 position:10%
<v Ticket Clerk>Deck or cabin?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Eleni>Deck. We want the sea air.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Ticket Clerk>Twenty-four euros each, cash or card, the boat is late.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.900
<v.loud Nikos>Look! Dolphins, <c.blue>right behind the stern</c>!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.800
<v Eleni>By noon the islands rise out of the haze,
one blue ridge after another.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.000
<v Nikos>Paros first, then Naxos <00:00:21.500>and the Portara.
